), CtrlS Datacenters (MEP works), Garden Reach Shipbuilders (electrical works, 7500 DWT vessel) and Navayuga Engineering (VTMS for Ramayapatnam Port) _(~6.4% of mcap)_.","**Aurionpro Solutions** — wins a **Rs 150 crore follow-on data-centre order from a global hyperscaler** for an AI-ready facility in Navi Mumbai, its third win from this customer in under a year _(~4.5% of mcap)_.","**Optivalue Tek Consulting** — revises a government-website order from Aroosha Technologies upward, **from Rs 16.25 crore to Rs 64.00 crore** _(~12.8% of mcap)_.","**A B Infrabuild** — wins a **Rs 48.10 crore EPC order from the Government of Chhattisgarh** for two grade separators on NH-53, over 18 months _(~6.0% of mcap)_.","**BCPL Railway Infrastructure** — bags a **Rs 37.26 crore order from Eastern Railway's Asansol division** to replace overaged electrification structures, over 12 months _(~33.1% of mcap)_.","**ARC Insulation & Insulators** — bags **two GFRP-rebar orders aggregating Rs 9.71 crore** from MRA Composites and NKT Infra _(~30.7% of mcap)_.","**TechD Cybersecurity** — wins its **largest single order to date, Rs 13.08 crore for a 3-year BFSI engagement**, taking its order book to Rs 70 crore _(~3.3% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Solex Energy** — secures a **new Rs 13.16 crore order for TopCon Bifacial G2G solar modules** from a domestic entity, for delivery by November 2026 _(~1.8% of mcap)_.","**Eleganz Interiors** — wins a **Rs 6.93 crore civil/interior fit-out contract from an undisclosed Mumbai-based media conglomerate**, due April 2027 _(~3.7% of mcap)_.","**Laser Power & Infra** — secures its **first commercial HTLS-conductor order, Rs 72.76 crore from Power Grid Corporation**, to reconductor ~164 circuit-km of two 132 kV lines under NERES-XXIV.","**Deem Roll-Tech** — receives an **export purchase order for rolls from an overseas customer, stated as exceeding Rs 1 crore** (exact value not disclosed beyond the floor).","**Larsen & Toubro** — its Power Transmission & Distribution arm wins multiple EPC orders — 380 kV transmission/substations in Saudi Arabia, 132/11 kV substations in the UAE, and a transmission system in Visakhapatnam, India — in L&T's own \"Mega\" classification band of **Rs 10,000-15,000 crore** (no single figure stated).","**JTL Industries** — secures an **export order from Canada for ~5,000 MT of Black Welded Hollow Sections, valued at approximately USD 3.4 million**, to be executed this quarter."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**D. P. Abhushan** — board approves a preferential issue of equity shares and warrants for **up to Rs 558.01 crore** (Rs 123.90 cr equity at Rs 1,430/share + Rs 434.11 cr of warrants at the same price), subject to shareholder approval at an EGM."],"equity_allotments":["**Alankit** — allots **5 crore fresh convertible warrants to promoter-group entity Alka Agarwal at Rs 8.60 each, for Rs 43.00 crore** _(~20.7% of mcap)_, on a preferential basis.","**Piramal Finance** — allots **82,94,000 fresh warrants to promoter-group entity Nithyam Realty for an aggregate Rs 1,750.03 crore**, of which Rs 437.51 crore (25%) is received now, on a preferential basis."],"m_and_a":["**Marico** — buys a further **24.09% stake in subsidiary Satiya Nutraceuticals (Plix) for Rs 1,012.03 crore**, taking its holding from 60% to 84.09%; the remaining 14.09% is under a right of first refusal for up to Rs 592 crore plus milestones, due July 2027.","**Frog Innovations** — approves acquiring **VLS Developers (owner of land and a building the company had earlier agreed to buy) for a total consideration of Rs 36.00 crore**, making VLS a wholly owned subsidiary _(~9.1% of mcap, our arithmetic on the stored ratio)_.","**Imagicaaworld Entertainment** — signs a binding MoU to sell its **Hotel Novotel Imagicaa at Khopoli to Juniper Hotels for a lumpsum Rs 248.00 crore slump sale** _(~8.6% of mcap)_, subject to shareholder postal-ballot approval.","**Juniper Hotels** — agrees to **acquire the operating Hotel Novotel Imagicaa at Khopoli from Imagicaaworld Entertainment for Rs 248.00 crore** _(~5.2% of mcap)_, under a binding MoU subject to definitive documentation.","**Sai Parenterals** — completes the acquisition of a **60% stake in R&D platform Prathyak Laboratories (Genome Valley, Hyderabad) for Rs 15 crore**, funded from unutilised IPO proceeds, replacing its planned greenfield research centre; the remaining 40% carries a right of first refusal at the same valuation.","**Maithan Alloys** — acquires **2,527,000 shares (0.17%) of HFCL through the stock exchange for Rs 60.09 crore**, a portfolio investment with no intent to acquire control.","**Kothari Petrochemicals / Kothari Sugars and Chemicals** — NCLT (Chennai) orders both companies to convene shareholder and creditor meetings on 13 November for their proposed amalgamation of Kothari Sugars into Kothari Petrochemicals; the secured creditor has already consented.","**Popular Vehicles and Services** — promoters and promoter-group members (the Paul and Philip families) execute a Family Settlement Agreement realigning ownership, management and voting rights across group entities, including the company's shareholding; the company is not itself a party and no value is disclosed."],"capex_core":["**Nelcast** — board approves setting up a **machining division at Gudur, Andhra Pradesh for ~Rs 75 crore** _(~7.1% of mcap)_, funded via internal accruals and borrowings, to add value-added machining capacity for its castings.","**ACME Solar Holdings** — commissions an additional **66.68 MW of solar capacity at its Rajasthan hybrid project**, taking commissioned capacity to 133.36 MW of the 300 MW project under its NTPC power-purchase agreement."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 6 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**SEPC** — Madras High Court lifts attachment on **Rs 154 crore of receivables** after a Rs 149.5 crore settlement paid entirely by another party under a 2015 indemnity agreement; nil cash outflow for SEPC and all banking restrictions are lifted.","**Embassy Developments** — records **Rs 1,800 crore in pre-sales at the launch of Embassy Origins**, a new residential project."],"distress_risk":["**BGR Energy Systems** — signs a Master Restructuring Agreement with NARCL covering **Rs 3,736 crore of outstanding debt** (Rs 1,245 cr sustainable, Rs 2,491 cr unsustainable); sustainable debt repays over 4 years to September 2030 and NARCL receives 20% of the company's equity plus 2 nominee directors.","**SAB Events & Governance Now Media** — completes payment of all outstanding dues to financial and operational creditors under its NCLT-approved pre-packaged resolution plan, closing out the process.","**Opto Circuits (India)** — its Committee of Creditors (78.62% voting share) replaces the Resolution Professional with Waterfall Insolvency Professional Private Limited, represented by Ms. Shirley Mathew, in the company's ongoing CIRP.","**Reliance Communications** — files a Committee of Creditors update under its ongoing CIRP _(scanned filing, not legible — carried from the subject line only)_."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Indian Overseas Bank** — India Ratings upgrades its Basel III Tier II bonds and long-term issuer rating to **IND AA+ from AA**, outlook revised to Stable from Positive."],"other_notable":["**PVR INOX** — completes extinguishment of **20,68,965 equity shares (~2.1% of pre-buyback capital)** bought back under its buyback programme that closed in September."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"or